# S8.6.4 actual fixed-image Caption review

## Scope and method

Nonblind agent review against the original-pixel rubric frozen before these outputs. This is **caption extraction only**. It does not establish that a full RAG question was rerun, a downstream answer passed, or the Owner accepted the milestone. No new Provider calls, tests, source edits or Prompt edits were made during this review.

Rubric SHA256: `cdc7e48e29fea180194b7ac9b5abad922dc91b0c5a3e2bde1cc0f6919409490b`. Raw inputs, native response bodies, saved captions and SETTLED ledger counters were reconciled locally. All recorded evidence checks passed. Every old/candidate pair has the same exact image bytes, provider/model identity, fixed options and scope; request IDs are fresh and distinct.

